					"id": "tG2l-nugYh45tphwG",
					"name": "Mandiblasters",
					"local_notes": "Lore: A last, close-in bite from a helmet fitted with venomous, mechanical mandibles, used when the blade already has the kill in hand.\n\nDesign: Innate Attack (Toxic, token 1d, melee reach C only, B61), the same reduced-reach math this project's Betcher's Gland Corrosive Spit entry uses, for the helmet-mounted neurotoxin mandiblasters every Striking Scorpion wears as a guaranteed backup bite.",
