			"name": "Aspect: Dark Reaper",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Slow, deliberate heavy-weapons specialists who trade an Aspect's usual speed for the range and firepower of the reaper launcher.\n\nDesign: Net 1 point, per-Aspect flavour lens.",
