			"name": "Aspect: Swooping Hawk",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Jump-pack skirmishers who drop grenade packs from above before landing to finish the fight, or simply vanishing again.\n\nDesign: Net 2 points, per-Aspect flavour lens.",
