		},
		{
			"id": "TC0ltQ6AZxbKmeI1B",
			"name": "Aspect: Warp Spider",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The strangest Aspect: warriors whose jump generators tear a short hole in real space rather than merely leap it, blinking in and out of a firefight where no jump pack could follow.\n\nDesign: Net 1 point, per-Aspect flavour lens.",
			"tags": [
				"Xenos",
				"Aeldari"
			],
			"children": [
				{
					"id": "tK15rZPHGtJNnxnya",
					"name": "Displacement Sense",
					"local_notes": "Lore: A Warp Spider who has jumped a hundred times develops a real, trained instinct for exactly when and where to trigger the next one — the difference between landing behind an enemy line and landing inside a wall.\n\nDesign: Perk (B9), +1 to Piloting (Jump Generator). The jump generator's own short-range teleport effect is a wargear property (a warp- technology item, not a psychic power the wearer casts) and belongs on that item's own future equipment entry, per the same equipment-vs-physiology split this project's Black Carapace entry draws; this lens covers only the wearer's own trained reflex for timing and steering a jump.",
					"tags": [
						"Perk",
						"Xenos",
						"Aeldari"
					],
					"base_points": 1,
					"features": [
						{
							"type": "skill_bonus",
							"selection_type": "skills_with_name",
							"name": {
								"compare": "is",
								"qualifier": "Piloting"
							},
							"amount": 1,
							"specialization": {
								"compare": "is",
								"qualifier": "Jump Generator"
							}
						}
					]
				}
			],
			"disabled": true
		}
	],
	"skills": [
		{
			"id": "s-v7womlBBLkDL4_E",
			"name": "Broadsword",
			"local_notes": "Lore: An Exarch's signature blade (an Exarch's power weapon, or a Striking Scorpion's chainsword-claw, or equivalent), the single most-drilled skill of an entire centuries-long life, further sharpened by Trained By A Master and Weapon Master above.\n\nDesign: DX+7 (25) for 32 points, Average (B208); Trained By A Master lets this default from other combat skills at only -1, and Weapon Master doubles this skill's effective damage bonus rather than adding to the roll.",
			"tags": [
				"Xenos",
				"Aeldari"
			],
			"difficulty": "dx/a",
			"points": 32
		},
